    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9">
        <head>Cn 1018 9</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#kennedy" n="9" corresp="#wit-d">Manslagan 7 manswaran. hadbrican. 7 æwbrican. gebugan 7 gebetan. oððe of cyððe mid synne gewitan.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">Manslagan and manswaran, hadbrican and æwbrican, gebugan and gebetan, oððe of cyððe mid synne gewitan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#kennedy" corresp="#wit-d">Killers and perjurers, violators of the clergy and adulterers shall submit and make amends, or leave their native land with their sins.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">Murderers and perjurers, those who violate holy orders and those who violate their marriage vows shall submit and do penance or leave their native land with their sins.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
